{"id":"entrapment","status":"ready","status_label":"ACTIVE — E-SF 4-ITEM SHORT FORM","name":"Entrapment Scale Short-Form (E-SF)","participant_measure":"E-SF","original_measure":"Entrapment Scale (Gilbert & Allan, 1998)","relationship":"validated_short_form_not_score_equivalent_to_16_item_original","version":"De Beurs et al. 2020, 4-item E-SF","construct":"Entrapment","response_model":"4 items; 0=Not at all like me to 4=Extremely like me; summed score 0–16","rights":"The 2020 E-SF article is open access under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0. This implementation reproduces the published four-item form without modification and is intended for non-commercial research/educational use with attribution.","source":"https://eprints.whiterose.ac.uk/id/eprint/155499/","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","scoring":{"method":"sum","min":0,"max":16},"items":[{"text":"I often have the feeling that I would just like to run away.","options":[{"value":0,"label":"Not at all like me"},{"value":1,"label":"A little bit like me"},{"value":2,"label":"Moderately like me"},{"value":3,"label":"Quite a bit like me"},{"value":4,"label":"Extremely like me"}]},{"text":"I feel powerless to change things.","options":[{"value":0,"label":"Not at all like me"},{"value":1,"label":"A little bit like me"},{"value":2,"label":"Moderately like me"},{"value":3,"label":"Quite a bit like me"},{"value":4,"label":"Extremely like me"}]},{"text":"I feel trapped inside myself.","options":[{"value":0,"label":"Not at all like me"},{"value":1,"label":"A little bit like me"},{"value":2,"label":"Moderately like me"},{"value":3,"label":"Quite a bit like me"},{"value":4,"label":"Extremely like me"}]},{"text":"I feel I'm in a deep hole I can't get out of.","options":[{"value":0,"label":"Not at all like me"},{"value":1,"label":"A little bit like me"},{"value":2,"label":"Moderately like me"},{"value":3,"label":"Quite a bit like me"},{"value":4,"label":"Extremely like me"}]}]}